        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Sorry, I don't think it is too much for users to have explicit definitions for textobjects that they want to use. And as already was said, \"argument\" and \"function_call\" may need configuration so having them in `gen_spec` makes sense.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
