        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "That's disappointing to hear, maybe i lack perspective but I didn't think that there would be such a maintenance burden from exposing whats already implemented. I just want to use the existing builtin textobjects with a different key; now I have to repeat the esoteric definitions and lose out on updates unless I manually check whether they have changed. ",
